  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The primary open-source Python toolkit for quantitative digital pathology analysis — colour normalisation, nuclei segmentation, and feature extraction for H&E and IHC slides. Apache 2.0, NIH-funded, Kitware-maintained, v1.4.0 (February 2025). Integrates with the Digital Slide Archive for web-based annotation workflows. Complements QuPath in the MACH catalog: QuPath is the interactive desktop analysis platform; HistomicsTK provides the programmatic Python API for batch analysis pipelines.",
